      {
        "pageNumber": 6,
        "kind": "FROZEN_TEMPLATE",
        "html": "<article class=\"vrpt-report\" data-visual-batch=\"BAZI-DYNAMIC-R1-BATCH-01\" data-frozen-intro=\"P06\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><section class=\"vrpt-page\"  data-page-number=\"6\" data-master=\"M03\"><header data-part=\"chrome\"><div><strong>P H I O S</strong><small>HUMAN POTENTIAL INTELLIGENCE</small></div><span>八字 · 完整报告</span></header><div class=\"vrpt-heading\"><div><small>结构层</small><h2><span>你的八字总览</span></h2><p>这份读取从怎样的结构出发？</p></div></div><div data-part=\"page-body\"><figure class=\"vrpt-primary\"><section class=\"vrpt-tile\" ><h3>四柱命盘</h3><div data-part=\"snapshot\"><div data-part=\"pillars\"><article class=\"vrpt-tile\" data-selected=\"false\"><h4>年柱</h4><small>天干</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"EARTH\">己</b><span>JI · 阴</span><strong data-element=\"EARTH\">土</strong><hr><small>地支</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"FIRE\">巳</b><span>SI</span><strong data-element=\"FIRE\">火</strong></article><article class=\"vrpt-tile\" data-selected=\"false\"><h4>月柱</h4><small>天干</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"METAL\">庚</b><span>GENG · 阳</span><strong data-element=\"METAL\">金</strong><hr><small>地支</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"FIRE\">午</b><span>WU</span><strong data-element=\"FIRE\">火</strong></article><article class=\"vrpt-tile\" data-selected=\"true\"><h4>日柱</h4><small>天干</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"WATER\">癸</b><span>GUI · 阴</span><strong data-element=\"WATER\">水</strong><hr><small>地支</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"EARTH\">丑</b><span>CHOU</span><strong data-element=\"EARTH\">土</strong></article><article class=\"vrpt-tile\" data-selected=\"false\"><h4>时柱</h4><small>天干</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"EARTH\">戊</b><span>WU · 阳</span><strong data-element=\"EARTH\">土</strong><hr><small>地支</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"FIRE\">午</b><span>WU</span><strong data-element=\"FIRE\">火</strong></article></div><div data-part=\"context\"><section class=\"vrpt-tile\" ><h3>日主</h3><b data-glyph data-element=\"WATER\">癸</b><p>GUI · 阴 水</p></